OptiForge 0.1.0 - a profile-guided optimizing compiler

usage: optiforge <input.of> [options]

Output:
  -o <file>            Write output to <file>
  --emit=<stage>       Stop after <stage> and dump its result
                       (tokens, ast, ir, cfg, asm, obj)

Optimization:
  -O0                  No optimization (default)
  -O1                  Basic optimization
  -O2                  Full optimization

Diagnostics:
  -Werror              Treat warnings as errors

General:
  -h, --help           Show this message
      --version        Show the version
